These do not include the passive pins, just those that affect the player's weapon.


Kiara pins
Overall mechanic: attacks apply a burn mark that deals Dot for 3 seconds and expires, it stacks up to X times max.
• Basic attack: deals damage and applies 1 stack per hit.
• Special attack: deals damage and applies 2 stacks of hit.
• dodge: doubles the stacks of your next attack, does not apply to ultimate or Infusion.
• Infusion: leaves a fire area that deals damage equal to fire DoT, does not apply stacks.
• ultimate : nukes the whole area dealing high damage and applies 5 stacks.


Gura pins
Overall mechanics: displaces enemies on hit.
• Basic attack: deals damage and pushes enemies away.
• Special attack: deals damage and pulls enemies in.
• Dodge: turn dodge into charge that deals high damage on impact.
• Infusion: attacks shoot a water blade for the next X seconds.
• Ultimate: Sink into the grounds and do the cliche jaws attack.


pekora Pins
Overall mechanics: explosions.
• Basic attack: attack applies a bomb to the enemy which explodes, application has a cooldown
• Special attack: same as basic but higher numbers.
• Dodge: leaves a trail of explosions.
• Infusion: throws grenades around you.
• Ultimate: pauses time for a bit and allows you to lock on a missile to a target or area.


Suisei pins
Overall mechanics: Deals an additional cleave.
• Basic attack: deals an extra hit of damage.
• Special attack:same as basic.
• Dodge: next hit deals cleave regardless of pin equipped, double cleave if suisei  pin is equipped.
• Infusion: gains a damage increase for x seconds.
• Ultimate: hit enemy with an axe dealing high damage and multiple cleave for the next 5 seconds.


Kanata pins
Overall mechanics: Build salvation bar and hit enemies with smite.(smite get activated with special)
• Basic attack: deal damage and gain 5 points of salvation per hit.
• Special attack: same as basic but build 10 salvation.
• Dodge: makes you invisible and immune for 5 seconds after dodge, gets canceled if you attack.
• Infusion: IDK, please help with this!!!!
• Ultimate: Spears rain from the sky and gives you two smite hits.


Altare Pins
Overall mechanics: chances to deal double damage.
• Basic attack:deal high damage with a change for double damage
• Special attack: chances for triple damage.
• Dodge: change dodge into running.
• Infusion: increases crit damage.
• Ultimate: Blade's ultimate from marvel rivals.


Iroha pins
Overall mechanics: high attack speed.
• Basic attack: deals damage and animations are faster.
• Special attack: same as basic.
• Dodge: turns into parry.
• Infusion: increases attack speed.
• Ultimate: huge damage area of sword slashes.


Roboco Pins 
Overall mechanic: chain lighting
• Basic attack: deals damage and chains lighting between enemies
• Special attack: same as basic
• Dodge: creates a discharge of electricity.
• Infusion: IDK what to add here
• Ultimate: throws a light rod at an enemy causing them to get striked for X seconds.


Lamy pins
Overall mechanics: attack apply slow and free at max stacks.
• Basic attack: deals damage and applies 1 stack of freeze
• Special attack: same as basic
• Dodge: creates a pulse of snow that applies 2 stacks.
• Infusion: makes a small snow tornado that pulls enemies in.
• Ultimate: start a blizzard that deals high damage and applies stacks.


Noel Pins
Overall mechanics, slower attack speed but gains a minor stun and highr damage.
•  Basic attack: deals high damage and stuns for X seconds.
• Special attack: same as basic
• Dodge: turns into shield block from front facing damage
• Infusion: decreases enemy defense for X seconds.
• Ultimate: a mace falls from the sky deals high damage and applies stunning in a wide area for X seconds.